helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155621				0	ja	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\" name=\"印刷...\"\>印刷...\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145826				0	ja	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01140000.xhp\" name=\"プリンタの設定...\"\>プリンタの設定...\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
