helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	ja	戻り値:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	ja	文字列 (関数のみ)				20200411 15:09:53
