helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05320000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	ja	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:TRISTATEBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_TEXTANIMATION:TSB_PIXEL\"\>増分値はピクセル単位で指定します。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05320000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149766				0	ja	ピクセル				20200411 15:09:53
