helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	ja	\<image id=\"img_id3154490\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154490\"\>アイコン\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
