helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159083	39			0	ja	                     \<item type=\"input\"\>残存価額\</item\>                  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150002	40			0	ja	                     \<item type=\"input\"\>耐用年数\</item\>                  				20200411 15:09:53
