helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147579				0	ja	\<image id=\"img_id3147585\" src=\"svx/res/cd02.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147585\"\>アイコン\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
