helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060201.xhp	0	help	par_id3146940				0	ja	\<image id=\"img_id3146947\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_beziermove.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146947\"\>アイコン\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
