helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153298				0	ja	\<image id=\"img_id3153309\" src=\"sd/res/imagelst/nv06.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153309\"\>アイコン\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
