helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154029				0	ja	\<image id=\"img_id3154044\" src=\"res/helpimg/sc10617.png\" width=\"0.583in\" height=\"0.333in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154044\"\>アイコン\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
